<title>GREECE: Greek Ionian Bank to cut depo rates 50 bps Dec 2.</title>
<headline>Greek Ionian Bank to cut depo rates 50 bps Dec 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's state Ionian Bank said it will slash its deposit, time deposit and certificate of deposit rates by 50 basis points effective December 2.</p>
<p>The base deposit rate will be reduced to 11 percent from 11.50 percent, it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
